                <pb facs="0810" n="716" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg716"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-06"><hi rendition="#italic">May 6,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Report by cable upon present status of <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>
                    case. Give names of prisoners claiming to be American citizens.</p>
            </div>
